<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Memramcook is one of the oldest Acadian communities in the country, and the valley between Moncton and Sackville is still full of farmhouses that have heated with oil for generations. If your tank is pushing 15 years, or your insurance company just sent a letter asking how old it is, you're not alone. Hub City Tank Co replaces and removes residential oil tanks across the whole valley, from Saint-Joseph and Pré-d'en-Haut to College Bridge and Beaumont.</p><p>We're based in Moncton, about a 25 minute run down Route 2, so getting a truck to your door is easy. Every job starts with a free written estimate, and our crews are licensed and insured for both <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-moncton/">tank replacement</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-removal-moncton/">tank removal</a>. If a tank is leaking right now, skip the reading and call our 24/7 emergency line at (506) 802-3471.</p></div></div></section>
